{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f4688311cba4eb0b","name":"Bothan SpyNet Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-f4688311cba4eb0b","title":"Bothan SpyNet Talent Tree","revision":16345,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:44Z","sha256":"dd0e9c4d686d52c781a883f6918a6dddf424d0cb05320cc7c4212db09ca68a21","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16345","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bothan%20SpyNet%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f4688311cba4eb0b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained to work within the famed Bothan SpyNet. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Bothan SpyNet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Bothan_SpyNet","referenceId":"reference:e9b378f0f809a67b"}," is a secret collection of organic and electronic resources and personnel spread throughout the galaxy, accessed by computer or in person.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["SpyNet Agent"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothan","referenceId":"reference:d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d"},", or two Talents from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Infiltration Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Infiltration_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:202fc41cf6cdde41"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," check modifier instead of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," check modifier when making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," checks. You are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," skill for the purpose of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," reroll, you can reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Bothan Resources"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["SpyNet Agent"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your status within the SpyNet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted Items"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted_Items"},". With a successful DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," check, you can purchase standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", weapons, and transport services at 50% of the going rate, or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"}," and Restricted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", weapons, and transport services at 75% of the going rate.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knowledge is Life"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["SpyNet Agent"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate a single target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you gain a +2 morale bonus to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Score"}," of your choice against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knowledge is Power"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["SpyNet Agent"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate a single target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," against that target on a natural roll of 19 or 20.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you have another ability that increases your weapon's critical range against that target (such as the Elite Trooper's ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Extended Critical Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extended_Critical_Range"}]}," Talent, or the Jedi Knight's ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vaapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vaapad"}]}," Talent), you increase this range by 1 (for example, from 19-20 to 18-20). However, anything other than a Natural 20 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll anything other than a Natural 20 and still miss the target, you do not score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knowledge is Strength"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["SpyNet Agent"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate a single target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you gain a +2 morale bonus on attack rolls against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Six Questions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["SpyNet Agent"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have mastered the basic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothan","referenceId":"reference:d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d"}," philosophy of ",{"tag":"b","children":["Six Questions"]}," to glean more information from contacts through fewer questions. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate a single target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, you learn a target's Character Level, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Classes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Classes"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Scores"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Scores"},", and the target's available ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
